  "bamboo_observations": "Both detail levels have continuous upright culms and narrower leaf silhouettes. Arrival/stems retain amber window and closed gate remains visible. Palette unchanged. Portrait leaves remain cropped at edges and upper stage ceiling remains; desktop base-level silhouettes differ from lower detail as expected.",
  "remaining_art": "Camera framing, broad upper stage enclosure, granular wall/floor lighting and final foliage density remain open. Red source-ID pixels include authored planter beds and gate rails, not only unfinished backs.",
  "scope": "Incremental bamboo geometry review; no final all-site, device, release or service acceptance.",
  "allroom_observations": "All fourteen sites retain distinctive silhouettes and their actions in desktop and portrait. Qinfang/other geometry retains source preservation. Broad black bank/ground boundaries, large ceiling fields and existing granular lighting remain open art issues; facade/detail cropping is not claimed fixed by the bamboo source.",
  "desktop_moving_observations": "The approach shows the authored covered walkway before revealing the bamboo court; gate/window remain visible at the approach and settled view. Return shows rail/lattice foreground and Qinfang. No new bamboo stem breaks seen. General black walkway/backdrop treatment remains part of final art review.",
  "portrait_moving_observations": "Covered walk reveals the closed gate and amber window on approach; continuous stems remain visible in the settled view. Return retains lattice and Qinfang pavilion. Large upper ceiling, edge leaf crops and granular lighting remain open art work."
